# Who may publish (write) and subscribe (read) what. Anything not listed is
# denied.
#
# The truth is in BuildSim, where the physical model keeps it. Only the
# truth recorder brings it onto the broker, for the evaluation, and only
# storage may read it there: the controller must never see the truth
# (Lecture 2, slide 8; test T-27). The physical model and occupancysim are
# not here at all: they talk to BuildSim and nothing else.

user sensor
topic write obs/#
topic read time/#

# The building's clock is a sensor too, and the only one that may tell the time.
user clock
topic write time/#

user controller
topic read obs/#
topic write decision/#

user actuator
topic read obs/#
topic read time/#
topic write event/#
topic write state/#

user truthlog
topic write truth/#

user storage
topic read obs/#
topic read truth/#
topic read decision/#
topic read event/#

user viz
topic read obs/#
topic read decision/#
topic read event/#
topic read state/#
